ab · Unit 2</b> (20 min). Whole-unit revision, teams against each other. Open Somerset Arcade below: it starts Point Grab on the Unit 2 questions. The test has no speaking part.", "main": ["Check the Get ready homework (p.22) while teams get set up", "Point Grab · Unit 2 — 20 min", "Unit 2 test (pp. 23–24) — 30 min, alone, in pen. Play the listening first: each conversation twice. <a href=\"audio/test/Unit%202%20Test%20-%20Listening.mp3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Listening audio (2:43)</a>", "Collect the tests. Correct together next lesson (Correct-together slides, pp. 23–24 answers)"], "extra": "Puzzler 7 · Who's who? — for anyone who finishes the test early", "arcade": ["pointGrab", "unit 2", "Point Grab · Unit 2"], "arcadeUrl": "/arcade/index.html#unit=unit-02&play=pointGrab&topic=unit%202", "arcadeLabel": "Point Grab · Unit 2 · 20-minute revision", "slides": "slides/L7_Wed-28-Oct.pdf"}};</script><script>
